					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A beautiful monstrosity, or, to envoke the surrealist parlour game, An Exquisite Corpse. As was mentioned by 914's author, it may not be the 'true' origin, but it is a great one to be contemplated.</p> <p><strong>Edit</strong><br /> Upon reflection of the mass of 914, the potential of the human cost struck me. Particularly since he only seemed to be using one or two organs from each subject.</p> 
				 	]]>
