				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Gears</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>172464</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is very true…however, this story is so very, very close to my idea for 914's creation, i think both could very possibly be true. Mine has more of a hedonistic bent, while this has more of a "monument to madness" lean. Both work, but in different directions. In the spirit of "1984", I think I shall hold both to be true.</p> 
				 	]]>
