						 <p>You know, being the creator of 914, there's nothing stopping you from replacing your own creation story for it with this one, if you want to. (Not knowing yours, I can't say if one is better than the other, I'm just saying the option is, as always, there. Personal canon on this site is clearly much more important than any *actual* canon. You've said this yourself, I believe. :)</p> 
