				<wikidot:authorName>Photosynthetic</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>361873</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The latter, I think.</p> <p>Ye gods. This is terrible and beautiful. I jolted back and forth between (sometimes) falling with Sankt into the rush of creation, anticipating with him the marvelous end product, and (more often) recoiling at the inhuman care with which he selected his <em>materials</em>. It left me unnerved and shivering. Bravo.</p> <p>…I'll never look at 914 the same way again.</p> 
				 	]]>
